{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17side_level_act17side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act17side",
  "stageId": "act17side_06",
  "title": "中央通道",
  "storyCode": "SN-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "afee69af33fabceeb37048856635f9e8762ef1b6d22b1f15b061867530736540",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布雷奧甘，是那把鑰匙的主人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他在伊比利亞的黃金時代成為了王公貴族的座上賓，人們曾一度以為他象徵著阿戈爾島民與伊比利亞人和諧共處的開端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒人知道他在災難前做了什麼，又來不及做什麼，但是他確確實實留下了足夠多的遺產......以及對你們來說，足夠多的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他已經屬於過去，毫無疑問，現在做出選擇的是你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那把鑰匙......布雷奧甘的鑰匙遺落在卡西米爾的緣由，是一個我們沒必要知曉的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但找到它的，是獵人斯卡蒂。這不是什麼巧合，這是必然。你們對海洋天生敏感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是的，我把鑰匙交給了那個樂隊。你會知道她們是什麼樣的存在。也許阿戈爾人需要爭取她們的幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她們也在尋找答案。她們大多年輕，也對海洋的變化感到不適，畢竟她們無法真正離開自己誕生的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊......希望我們能夠成功。人類有太多問題需要面對，層層累疊的災難可以輕鬆撕毀現在的文明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歌蕾蒂婭，你想單獨行動，我不會勸阻你。斯卡蒂與你相似，也許獵人都是相似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但千萬別覺得，自己能解決陸地上的所有問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你問吧，對你，我有問必答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ishar-mla......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在哪裡聽到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g24_cloudy_sea"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們就快到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，海洋......太寬廣了，模糊的座標會帶來極大的誤差......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......而且海洋比我想的要平靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過於平靜了，離開那座燈塔後，我們遭遇的襲擊反而變得更少了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "甚至......沒有風浪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這意味著什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這意味著——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可憐的小鳥，你在緊張嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀！你、你什麼時候——別站在我背後！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有緊張，我只是......很少很少有人能深入海洋到這個地步，我......我不確定......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你在凝視身後，而非眼前。你在害怕失去，而不是面對未知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的長官為你創造了前往斯圖提斐拉的契機，接觸阿戈爾的契機，不是為了讓你這麼優柔寡斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你得在戰鬥來臨之前......唔。鯊魚，你聞到了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，讓這艘舒適的小船微微向右，我們就能看見那艘更大的船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那裡已經是一座巢穴，我們真的要去那裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幽靈鯊，你要不要休息一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？我有什麼不對的地方嗎？為什麼這麼問？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的手在抖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幽靈鯊看向自己的手。沒有握著武器的手，正在海風中微微顫抖。\n她的意識逐漸明晰，又極快地墜入深海，觸碰不得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......啊，我這是在激動嗎？還是......感動？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂婭默默握住了幽靈鯊的手，斯卡蒂隨之效仿，三名深海獵人沉默了片刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歡迎回家。獵人們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂婭默默地走上船頭。\n海風推開夜晚，傳遞著熟悉的氣味。\n一艘安靜的大船，在海面上酣眠沉睡。它是海風的臣民，時代的貴客。\n而那曾是一個遍地理想的時代，人們的探索精神在它身上體現得淋漓盡致，傲慢亦然。\n斯卡蒂與歌蕾蒂婭無聲地眺望著那艘船。\n一瞬間她們想起了很多，但最後無疑都回到了自己的過去，童年，故土，與當下船舶搖晃的頻率。\n唯有幽靈鯊微微抱緊了手裡的武器，海風微拂。\n海風會把獵人們帶回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g16_lighthouse_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（沿石面爬行的窸窣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mon3tr，燒毀它們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（尖嘯）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡門閣下，我們沒有太多時間停留在這裡。獵人們的隊伍會有危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "懲戒軍被束縛住了腳步，看來我還是低估了深海教會的滲透程度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們本該在格蘭法洛清理出一片臨時陣地後再跟上他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們別無選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果無法確保格蘭法洛，就意味著我們會腹背受敵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個伊比利亞大陣至少有十個連隊，三千人規模，懲戒軍中的幕僚們足以指揮他們贏下這場戰爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你對懲戒軍似乎頗為瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們打過不少交道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼你的意思是，我們將格蘭法洛交給懲戒軍，先行前往伊比利亞之眼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我們面對的是維多利亞的艦隊，我並不反對這個提案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "否則我們的損失將更加慘重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（獨奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Frost女士？你為什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她說，這叫體能訓練。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們來自海洋。我們就是海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然......（悲愴的獨奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果你們願意幫忙，那麼再好不過。你能做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓它們聽話。聽我唱歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的同伴們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，Dan想借用那座禮拜堂。她們都在那裡思考新的曲子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "音樂？你們的音樂和以前我在萊塔尼亞所聽到的大不相同，你們會對這種東西感興趣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（緊湊的獨奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "音樂，才是生活的意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是想在演出開始前，清場而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Frost緩緩取出了她的吉他。\n卡門略感訝異。他能感覺到面前這個生物確確實實在思考名為“音樂”的藝術。她的話語裡沒有任何多餘的用意。\n音樂絕非比喻。將這個詞用以比喻其他事物都會讓Frost分心。她只考慮音樂，這種能取悅她靈魂的藝術才能引起她的注意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（畏縮的窸窣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嘗試性的獨奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那些潛藏著的恐魚，環繞在她的身旁，觀察，審視，判斷。\n它們不敢輕易靠近。它們嗅到了熟悉的味道。它們意識到眼前的吉他手只是空殼。她悠遠的聯繫在它們血脈饋贈的深處隱隱作響。\n即使這裡仍是陸地，它們卻在瞬間感覺自己回到了海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（困惑打轉的窸窣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多麼......神奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些與大地本身息息相關的生物，在它們眼中，人類與恐魚是否毫無區別？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Frost沒有回答，她對旋律如癡如醉，對激情本身要求嚴苛。\n凱爾希知道，這個問題是問自己的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，這也在你的盤算之中？讓她們坐鎮海岸，讓懲戒軍深入大海？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您願意這麼想，那我就是這麼想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是懲戒軍甚至沒來得及為我們準備好一艘船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海岸上還有一艘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從格蘭法洛計畫廢止開始，它已經等了很多年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......必須先斬斷留在陸地上的惡根。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是一名審判官。我不會坐視潛伏在伊比利亞的邪惡在我眼前溜走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g21_goldenboat_deck"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鬆、鬆手，別這麼抱著我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是不抱著你，孱弱的小鳥，你根本沒法爬上這麼高的甲板呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我不是這個意思——嘖，算了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "審判官艾麗妮只是怔怔地看著眼前的景色。\n漆黑的海面，昏暗的光線。六十年的時間彷彿在船桅處停滯不前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡就是......斯圖提斐拉，“愚人號”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滿載學者與軍人的旗艦，隕落王族在海洋上的行宮......和書本上的記錄......差別很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等、等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這艘船這麼大，你要在這裡找什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布雷奧甘是個阿戈爾人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這把鑰匙，一定藏著一個阿戈爾人想要留下的線索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鑰匙？那麼鎖在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正打算找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼大艘船，六十年就這麼漂泊在海上，你打算怎麼找——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許你這樣年輕的伊比利亞人沒有接觸過太多這樣的運輸工具。即使有布雷奧甘的協助，它也被製造得如此粗糙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一路走來，海洋是否溫柔，你心裡有數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼我倒想請教你一個問題，這艘船，“為什麼沒沉”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "腳步聲。沉重的，黏稠的腳步聲。\n在這本不該有什麼活物的甲板上，出現了一道影子。\n不，艾麗妮立刻斥責了自己的想法。歌蕾蒂婭的質詢同時也是疑問。岸上，海裡，她已經見過了那麼多的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在看清敵人的一瞬，天賦異稟的年輕審判官艾麗妮，本能的反應是，窒息。\n而在她回想起如何呼吸的時候，歌蕾蒂婭已經一步上前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——（尖銳的咆哮）——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竟然能躲開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它想逃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想都別想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它躲到了船艙裡！我們要追嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是的，它躲到了船艙裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可它怎麼會躲進船艙裡？這裡可是海的中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不止一隻。這艘船上不止一隻海嗣。恐魚更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們得分頭行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們去追。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我向下走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "向、向下，你們怎麼知道這艘船的構造——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道，切開就是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......這可是伊比利亞先賢最重要的遺產！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢，小鳥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我有義務監視你們，我和你們一起走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯圖提斐拉上有很多謎題，它既然能保存得這麼完整，為什麼六十年間從沒試過回到伊比利亞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "身為伊比利亞的審判官，我必須得到真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要牽著手嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你什麼意思？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是一顆才華的果實，但和你的敵人相比，你的努力和天資都變得不值一提。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我擔心一個不留神，我們就失去你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......別太瞧不起人，阿戈爾人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她就交給你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鯊魚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想起了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......海風告訴我，告訴我，有一座雕塑。它在哭泣，它在等我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以在這艘船上找到它嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，快些吧，鯊魚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我等著你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雕塑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我們一邊歡迎死者，一邊找找它藏身的地方吧，斯卡蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真高興你還記得我的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g23_goldenboat_pass"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真是......富麗堂皇的風格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，怎麼會這麼乾淨......這裡纖塵不染，看，地板甚至在反光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許是有人堅持打掃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們說要追蹤那隻怪物，你們真的追得到它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "氣味不會騙人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "儘管這裡盡是腐臭的味道，肯定有不少——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（勤勞的窸窣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐魚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡果然被這些怪物當作巢穴了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（在原地打轉的窸窣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——等等！幽靈鯊！氣味在我們腳下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ishar-mla。\nIshar-mla。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g22_goldenboat_hall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，剛才的衝擊......幽靈鯊，還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......幽靈鯊？勞倫緹娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在看什麼？鏡子？這裡怎麼會有一面鏡子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鏡子被打碎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是怎麼回事？伊比利亞人的水上運輸工具需要一座宮殿嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和羅德島差別真大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這面鏡子有什麼特別的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "起初，那是這面破碎鏡台的點點亮光。很快，這點點光亮化作了實影，那是它的眼。\n海嗣早在這裡等待。孤坐在這黃金的大廳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......Ishar-mla，La-tina，Louu-tina，Laren-tina......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這隻幼小的......不，它們不能用體形判斷力量。它是海嗣，又一隻，毫無疑問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有恐魚，恐魚群正在聚集！幽靈鯊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幽靈鯊置若罔聞。她怔怔看著鏡子。和鏡子後的海嗣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你記得我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "海嗣微微點頭。它困惑地看著幽靈鯊與斯卡蒂。它在思考。\n為什麼她們與“過去”不同？她們怎麼了？怎麼幫她們從累贅的血肉中解脫出來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幽靈鯊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別亂想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒亂想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "語氣變了。\n斯卡蒂驚訝地看著幽靈鯊。對於她在鹽風城時所表露出的片刻清醒，斯卡蒂始終沒能從歌蕾蒂婭或是凱爾希那裡得到一個確切的答覆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勞倫緹娜，你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勞倫緹娜，是啊，勞倫緹娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看，就在武器上的這一條經卷裡，我寫下自己的名字掛在上面的時候，我甚至還能記得我出生的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊......清醒的夢境。真是，又過了這麼久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幽靈鯊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，一會再感慨吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鹽風城也好，這艘陌生又熟悉的水上運輸工具也罷，真希望喚醒我的，是阿戈爾穹頂的光輝，而不是你們這些醜陋的怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你安靜地聽我說完。等等，你不會也想開口稱呼我們為同胞吧？怪彆扭的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來吧，你也小睡片刻如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沉進意識的泥沼，放棄生命的大權。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——（尖嘯）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
